      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Hardware Security</h1>
      <p>Hardware security is the foundation of trustworthy computing. MEAICON designs hardware-rooted security architectures that establish identity, protect data, and maintain integrity from the silicon level through the full device lifecycle. Our approach ensures that security is built into the platform — not bolted on as software after the fact.</p>
      <p>We engineer hardware security for mission-critical edge devices and infrastructure across the MEA region, providing the immutable trust foundation that defence, critical infrastructure, and regulated industries demand.</p>
